  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64459b6056cea83e",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6da27f00b49e8d47",
      "translationZh": "开源 LLM 现在已经达到了足以作为推理引擎来驱动智能体工作流的性能水平：Mixtral 在我们的基准测试中甚至超越了 GPT-3.5，而且通过微调，还可以轻松进一步提升其性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd4f69d47b0a5a91",
      "translationZh": "我们发布了目前最简单的智能体库：smolagents！快来这里看看 smolagents 的介绍博客吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a60d7aa976cdc887",
      "translationZh": "经过因果语言建模训练的大语言模型（LLM）可以处理广泛的任务，但它们往往难以应对逻辑、计算和搜索等基本任务。最糟糕的情况是，它们在数学等领域表现不佳，却仍然试图自行完成所有计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ba9cf7f9288dd9e",
      "translationZh": "为了克服这一弱点，除了其他方法之外，还可以将 LLM 集成到一个能够让它调用工具的系统中：这样的系统被称为 LLM 智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "321857c7d6636542",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们会解释 ReAct 智能体的内部工作原理，然后展示如何使用最近集成到 LangChain 中的 ChatHuggingFace 类来构建它们。最后，我们将对几个开源 LLM 进行基准测试，并与 GPT-3.5 和 GPT-4 进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c360f74dd1b9cc07",
      "translationZh": "什么是智能体？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "533e77335809937d",
      "translationZh": "用一个简单示例展示 ReAct 智能体的内部工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "466c51114b9129a2",
      "translationZh": "智能体系统面临的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f1be082bd503aeb",
      "translationZh": "使用 LangChain 运行智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5449e0628b342e1",
      "translationZh": "智能体大比拼：不同 LLMs 作为通用推理智能体的表现如何？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c360f74dd1b9cc07",
      "translationZh": "什么是智能体？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a732c94078085e95",
      "translationZh": "LLM 智能体的定义相当宽泛：所有以 LLM 为引擎、能够根据观察结果对其所处环境执行行动的系统，都是 LLM 智能体。它们可以通过多次迭代“感知 ⇒ 反思 ⇒ 行动”循环来完成任务，并且通常会借助规划或知识管理系统来增强性能。你可以在 Xi 等人于 2023 年发表的文章中找到一篇对智能体领域的出色综述。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0fda8b7021c177b",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们重点关注 ReAct 智能体。ReAct 是一种构建智能体的方法，其名称由“Reasoning”（推理）和“Acting”（行动）两个词拼接而成。在提示词中，我们描述模型及其可以使用哪些工具，并要求它“逐步”思考（也称为思维链行为），以规划并执行接下来的行动，最终得出答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "533e77335809937d",
      "translationZh": "ReAct 智能体内部工作机制的简单示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a497ee85f08e8630",
      "translationZh": "上面的图看起来很抽象，但其内部机制其实相当简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a71dc6a6e9869610",
      "translationZh": "看看这个 notebook：我们使用 Transformers 库实现了一个最基本的工具调用示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67ead202cfc3e3cc",
      "translationZh": "在循环中调用 LLM，所用提示词主要包含以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5fb2030a96ace91",
      "translationZh": "然后，你解析 LLM 的输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f2b2a3008f6076b",
      "translationZh": "如果其中包含字符串 ‘Final Answer:’，循环就结束，并打印答案，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43865d5db74be93b",
      "translationZh": "否则，LLM 应该已经输出了一次工具调用：你可以解析这一输出，获取工具名称和参数，然后使用这些参数调用该工具。随后，将此次工具调用的输出追加到提示词中，再带着这些扩充后的信息调用 LLM，直到它掌握足够的信息，能够最终给出问题的最终答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "719dc8b75344edf3",
      "translationZh": "例如，在回答“1:23:45 是多少秒？”这个问题时，LLM 的输出可能如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0edf36f8738a136d",
      "translationZh": "由于这一输出不包含字符串 ‘Final Answer:’，因此它是在调用工具：于是我们解析这一输出，获取工具调用参数：使用参数 {\"time\": \"1:23:45\"} 调用工具 convert_time。执行此次工具调用会返回 {'seconds': '5025'}。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57ccdea4c86dc06b",
      "translationZh": "于是，我们将这一整块内容追加到提示词中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61a5ce55f068519f",
      "translationZh": "新的提示词现在如下（实际版本会稍微更详尽一些）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e9ab0a5c2a5adac",
      "translationZh": "➡️ 我们使用这个新提示词再次调用 LLM。由于它可以在 Observation 中获取工具调用的结果，LLM 现在很可能会输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46ebd58f42e6472a",
      "translationZh": "任务就这样解决了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "466c51114b9129a2",
      "translationZh": "智能体系统面临的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e89bd257ddfdf805",
      "translationZh": "一般来说，对 LLM 引擎而言，运行智能体系统的难点在于：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "429e59ec7ad981a6",
      "translationZh": "从提供的工具中，选择能够帮助推进目标实现的工具：例如，当被问到“比 30,000 大的最小质数是多少？”时，智能体可以调用 Search 工具，搜索“K2 的高度是多少”，但这并没有帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43b117d7acb54042",
      "translationZh": "以严格的参数格式调用工具：例如，要计算一辆在 10 分钟内行驶了 3 公里的汽车的速度，你必须调用 Calculator 工具，用距离除以时间：即使你的 Calculator 工具接受 JSON 格式的调用：{”tool”: “Calculator”, “args”: “3km/10min”}，仍然有许多容易出错的地方，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71c51965137711d2",
      "translationZh": "工具名称拼写错误：“calculator”或“Compute”都无法奏效",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0ea15ae3ae4f602",
      "translationZh": "给出参数的名称，而不是参数的值：“args”: “distance/time”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "afb743d406c10dc0",
      "translationZh": "格式不规范：“args\": \"3km in 10minutes”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a24f3bbd7225d81c",
      "translationZh": "高效地吸收并利用过去的观测中收集到的信息，无论是初始上下文，还是使用工具后返回的观测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "190d21dd03dad926",
      "translationZh": "那么，一个完整的智能体配置会是什么样的呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f1be082bd503aeb",
      "translationZh": "使用 LangChain 运行智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9df4b1f37db2b60b",
      "translationZh": "我们刚刚集成了一个 ChatHuggingFace 封装器，让你可以在 🦜🔗LangChain 中基于开源模型创建智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43b139f03f8a1d15",
      "translationZh": "创建 ChatModel 并为其提供工具的代码非常简单，你可以在 Langchain 文档中查看全部内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f58e9563eeec41ad",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过为 chat_model 提供 ReAct 风格的提示词和工具，将其变成智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40177e6588a01a1e",
      "translationZh": "随后，智能体会处理输入：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7856f4ab2c33fd59",
      "translationZh": "智能体对决：开源 LLMs 作为通用推理智能体的表现如何？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "603d3f88b2fc3eec",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这里找到这项基准测试的代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee370aaa4585c0eb",
      "translationZh": "我们希望衡量开源 LLM 作为通用推理智能体的表现。因此，我们选择了需要运用逻辑和使用基本工具的问题：计算器和互联网搜索。最终的数据集由其他 3 个数据集的样本组合而成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c12d8b7ebace7314",
      "translationZh": "为了测试互联网搜索能力：我们从 HotpotQA 中选择了一些问题。它原本是一个检索数据集，但在能够访问互联网的情况下，也可以用于通用问答。有些问题原本就需要结合多个来源的信息：在我们的设置中，这意味着需要执行多步互联网搜索，以综合搜索结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41a0528525fa586c",
      "translationZh": "为了测试计算器的使用，我们添加了 GSM8K 中的问题：这个数据集测试小学数学能力，只要正确运用 4 种运算（加、减、乘、除），就能完全解答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af03fb485edeeff6",
      "translationZh": "我们还从 GAIA 中挑选了一些问题，这是一个面向通用 AI 助手、难度非常高的基准。原始数据集中的问题可能需要许多其他不同的工具，例如代码解释器或 PDF 阅读器：我们手动挑选了除搜索和计算器之外不需要其他工具的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bed8d53bb1255e3f",
      "translationZh": "评估采用 GPT-4-as-a-judge 进行，使用了基于 Prometheus 提示词格式的提示词，并给出 5 点李克特量表评分：具体提示词见此处。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d17d2d78d76e6a6c",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d57a9cb6fee5d46",
      "translationZh": "我们评估了几个表现强劲的开源模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9a54f8ac041ccde",
      "translationZh": "这些模型在 LangChain 的 ReAct 实现中接受评估。这意味着我们通过提示让它们以以下格式输出函数调用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f795ed2dfe43a30",
      "translationZh": "作为对比，我们还使用 LangChain 专为 OpenAI 设计的智能体，在相同的示例上评估了 GPT-3.5 和 GPT-4。由于该智能体使用的是它们自己的函数调用模板，而它们正是基于这一模板进行微调的，因此 OpenAI 模型应该能够发挥出最佳性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b62fcb983aabcd5",
      "translationZh": "由于这些开源模型并未针对以给定输出格式调用函数进行专门微调，因此与 OpenAI 智能体相比，它们略处于劣势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0457eb9cac584c25",
      "translationZh": "尽管如此，有些模型的表现确实非常出色！💪",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f526cf967359e5b",
      "translationZh": "下面是 Mixtral-8x7B 回答这个问题的示例：“贵阳和塔城，哪个城市的人口更多？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69c22aa300bc190e",
      "translationZh": "下面是各模型在我们评估数据集上的基准测试结果（原本按 1-5 分制计算的平均分已转换为 0-100% 的尺度，以便阅读）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f57a607fa1ee6cd",
      "translationZh": "如你所见，一些开源模型在驱动智能体工作流方面表现不佳：对于体量较小的 Zephyr-7b，这在意料之中，但 Llama2-70b 的表现之差却令人意外。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "293c952dc9ad2a1d",
      "translationZh": "👉 但 Mixtral-8x7B 的表现确实非常出色：它甚至击败了 GPT-3.5！🏆",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6847314ef42d867",
      "translationZh": "而且，这是开箱即用的表现：与 GPT-3.5 不同，据我们所知，Mixtral 并未针对智能体工作流进行微调，这在一定程度上限制了它的表现。例如，在 GAIA 上，10% 的问题之所以失败，是因为 Mixtral 尝试使用格式不正确的参数调用工具。如果针对函数调用和任务规划能力进行适当的微调，Mixtral 的得分很可能还会更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92ddcb98c2840376",
      "translationZh": "➡️ 我们强烈建议开源开发者开始针对智能体对 Mixtral 进行微调，以超越下一个挑战者：GPT-4！🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b456f873cec19ee9",
      "translationZh": "结束语：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "206276ee362b0f1b",
      "translationZh": "GAIA 基准测试虽然在这里仅使用了一个较小的问题子样本和少量工具进行测试，但它似乎是衡量模型在智能体工作流中整体表现的一个非常可靠的指标，因为它通常涉及多个推理步骤和严密的逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "36aaeb0a8b79c38c",
      "translationZh": "智能体工作流可以让 LLM 提升表现：例如，在 GSM8K 上，GPT-4 的技术报告给出的 5-shot CoT 提示成绩为 92%；为它配备计算器后，我们在 zero-shot 条件下达到了 95%。对于 Mixtral-8x7B，LLM Leaderboard 报告的 5-shot 成绩为 57.6%，而我们在 zero-shot 条件下取得了 73%。（请记住，我们只测试了 GSM8K 中的 20 道题。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
